# Docgen Revision 3

Delta on Revision 2. Order: root-cause → WP-A → WP-B → WP-E → WP-C → WP-D → regression.

## Non-negotiables
- Corner header logo NEVER falls back to cover unless `same_for_both`
- FormData keys: `logo_cover` / `logo_corner` (legacy aliases ok)
- `same_for_both` defaults false; corner upload clears it
- Preview cache key includes both logo SHAs + logo settings
- Format presets in `templates/formats/*.yaml`; sections never injected into exports
- Soft hyphens in PDF extract are NOT a bug (N7)

## Replaces Rev2
- `show_corner_on_cover` → `corner_pages`
- Header geometry → hug 14mm / margin 22mm
- `doc_types/*.yaml` → `formats/*.yaml`
